#: src/postulo/plugins/link_services/services.py:309
#, draft
msgid "Forgejo or Gitea"
msgstr "Forgejo nó Gitea"

#: src/postulo/plugins/link_services/__init__.py:39
#, draft
msgid "Services for web links"
msgstr "Seirbhísí do naisc ghréasáin"

#: src/postulo/plugins/link_services/__init__.py:41
#, draft
msgid ""
"Which services a social profile or a code repository can be on — LinkedIn, Mastodon, Bluesky, GitHub, GitLab, Codeberg, a Forgejo instance — what an address on each one looks like, and the icon drawn beside it. An address on none of them is listed as “Other”. Nothing here is ever looked up online."
msgstr ""
"Cé na seirbhísí ar féidir le próifíl shóisialta nó stór cóid a bheith orthu — LinkedIn, Mastodon, Bluesky, GitHub, GitLab, Codeberg, sampla Forgejo — cén chuma atá ar sheoladh ar gach ceann, agus an deilbhín a tharraingítear lena thaobh. Liostaítear seoladh ar aon cheann acu mar “Eile”. Ní lorgaítear aon rud anseo ar líne riamh."
